{
    "unit_id": "english_v1",
    "unit_title": "中学英語 Vol.1 (基礎編)",
    "order": 1,
    "chapters": [
        {
            "title": "1. be動詞と一般動詞",
            "sections": [
                {
                    "title": "be動詞",
                    "content_blocks": [
                        {
                            "type": "introduction",
                            "text": "英語の「＝（イコール）」の役割をするのがbe動詞です。主語によって形が変わりますが、基本の意味は「〜です」「〜にいる」の2つだけです。"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "point",
                            "title": "be動詞の使い分け",
                            "content": "**現在形**\\n- I → **am**\\n- You/We/They → **are**\\n- He/She/It → **is**\\n\\n**過去形**\\n- I/He/She/It → **was**\\n- You/We/They → **were**"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "example_problem",
                            "title": "例題1: be動詞の選択",
                            "problem": "適切なbe動詞を選びなさい。\\n(1) I ( ) a student.\\n(2) She ( ) busy yesterday.",
                            "solution_steps": [
                                "(1) 主語がIなので **am**",
                                "(2) 主語がShe、過去（yesterday）なので **was**"
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "point",
                            "title": "否定文と疑問文",
                            "content": "**否定文**: be動詞の後に **not**\\n- I am not tired.\\n\\n**疑問文**: be動詞を主語の前に\\n- Are you a student? - Yes, I am. / No, I'm not."
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "example_problem",
                            "title": "例題2: 疑問文への変換",
                            "problem": "This is your book. を疑問文にしなさい。",
                            "solution_steps": [
                                "be動詞 is を文頭に移動",
                                "答え: **Is this your book?**"
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "exercise",
                            "problems": [
                                {
                                    "q": "They ( ) happy now.",
                                    "a": "are"
                                },
                                {
                                    "q": "He ( ) not at home yesterday.",
                                    "a": "was"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "title": "一般動詞",
                    "content_blocks": [
                        {
                            "type": "introduction",
                            "text": "「食べる」「走る」「好き」など、動作や状態を表すのが一般動詞です。be動詞と混ぜてはいけません！"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "point",
                            "title": "三単現のS",
                            "content": "主語が「三人称単数（he, she, it, Ken, my mother など）」で、時制が現在のとき、動詞に **s** をつける。\\n- He **plays** soccer.\\n- She **studies** English. (yをiに変えてes)\\n- My father **watches** TV. (chにはes)"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "example_problem",
                            "title": "例題3: 三単現S",
                            "problem": "彼はテニスをします。\\nHe ( ) tennis.",
                            "solution_steps": [
                                "「する（スポーツを）」は play",
                                "主語が He（三人称単数）なので s をつける",
                                "答え: **plays**"
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "point",
                            "title": "否定文と疑問文",
                            "content": "**否定文**: do/does not + 動詞の原形\\n- I **don't** like fish.\\n- He **doesn't** play soccer.\\n\\n**疑問文**: Do/Does + 主語 + 動詞の原形?\\n- **Do** you like music? - Yes, I do. / No, I don't.\\n- **Does** she speak English? - Yes, she does."
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "example_problem",
                            "title": "例題4: 否定文",
                            "problem": "Ken plays the piano. を否定文にしなさい。",
                            "solution_steps": [
                                "三単現なので does not (doesn't) を使う",
                                "動詞は原形に戻す（plays → play）",
                                "答え: **Ken doesn't play the piano.**"
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "exercise",
                            "problems": [
                                {
                                    "q": "She ( ) English every day. [study]",
                                    "a": "studies"
                                },
                                {
                                    "q": "( ) you like cats? - Yes, I do.",
                                    "a": "Do"
                                },
                                {
                                    "q": "He ( ) not eat meat.",
                                    "a": "does"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "title": "2. 疑問詞",
            "sections": [
                {
                    "title": "5W1H",
                    "content_blocks": [
                        {
                            "type": "point",
                            "title": "疑問詞一覧",
                            "content": "- **What**: 何\\n- **Who**: 誰\\n- **When**: いつ\\n- **Where**: どこ\\n- **Why**: なぜ\\n- **How**: どのように"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "example_problem",
                            "title": "例題5: 疑問詞",
                            "problem": "適切な疑問詞を選びなさい。\\n( ) is your birthday? - It's May 5th.",
                            "solution_steps": [
                                "「いつ」を聞いている → When",
                                "答え: **When**"
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "exercise",
                            "problems": [
                                {
                                    "q": "( ) is this? - It's a pen.",
                                    "a": "What"
                                },
                                {
                                    "q": "( ) do you get up? - At 6.",
                                    "a": "When"
                                },
                                {
                                    "q": "( ) old are you? - I'm 13.",
                                    "a": "How"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}